2605 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 4011 0 R
/ActualText (ReadOnlyMany: This access mode allows multiple pods to read from the PV or PVC, but does not allow any of them to write to it. This access mode is useful for cases where many pods need to read the same data, such as when serving a read-only database.)
/Pg 188 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
2606 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 4012 0 R
/ActualText (ReadWriteMany: This access mode allows multiple pods to read and write to the PV or PVC simultaneously. This mode is appropriate for use cases where many pods need to read and write to the same data, such as a distributed file system.)
/Pg 188 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
2607 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 4013 0 R
/ActualText (Execute: This access mode allows the pod to execute the data on the PV or PVC but not read or write to it. This mode is useful for use cases where the data is meant to be executed by the pods only, such as application code.)
/Pg 188 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
