/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (6. Now lets scale up the replicas in values.yml \(change value from 1 to 4\) 7. To update those changes we will use : helm upgrade mustafa . 8. Now lets see the pods count, it will gets increased from 1 to 4. 9. Now we can see the  release using the command helm list then revision\(version\) will gets increased from 1 to 2 10. To rollback to prev revision : helm rollback mustafa 1 The above command will rollback to 1st version  Once we perform the above command we can see the pods count will be scaledown from 4 to 1 again.)
/E (6. Now lets scale up the replicas in values.yml \(change value from 1 to 4\) 7. To update those changes we will use : helm upgrade mustafa . 8. Now lets see the pods count, it will gets increased from 1 to 4. 9. Now we can see the  release using the command helm list then revision\(version\) will gets increased from 1 to 2 10. To rollback to prev revision : helm rollback mustafa 1 The above command will rollback to 1st version  Once we perform the above command we can see the pods count will be scaledown from 4 to 1 again.)
/Pg 220 0 R
